user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T09:17:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T09:18:00Z","body":"One potential workaround is to refactor the `Shared` struct into two parts, values and properties, then add a dedicated `integer` mode to the range type that directly uses the `ValueI` when enabled, and `ValueF` when disabled.\n```cpp\nstruct Shared {\n\tvoid* value = nullptr; // One of ValueF* or ValueI*, is there a safer way to do this?\n\tbool exp_ratio = false;\n\tbool allow_greater = false;\n\tbool allow_lesser = false;\n\tHashSet<Range *> owners;\n\tvoid emit_value_changed();\n\tvoid emit_changed();\n\tvoid redraw_owners();\n};\n\nstruct ValueF {\n\tdouble val = 0.0;\n\tdouble min = 0.0;\n\tdouble max = 100.0;\n\tdouble step = 1.0;\n\tdouble page = 0.0;\n}\n\nstruct ValueI {\n\tlong val = 0;\n\tlong min = 0;\n\tlong max = 100;\n\tlong step = 1;\n\tlong page = 0;\n};\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546386646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546910288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112909#issuecomment-3546910288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112909","id":3546910288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TaY5Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T10:52:14Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T10:52:14Z","body":"Thank you for reporting, this is the same underlying issue as:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/33095\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94686\n\nClosing to keep things in one place, please see there for more information ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546910288/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via